  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4134101",
      "subQuestName": "与蒙蒙对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413410101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413410101": {
            "id": "413410101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "编霄灯好难啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410102"
            ]
          },
          "413410102": {
            "id": "413410102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410103"
            ]
          },
          "413410103": {
            "id": "413410103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，你知道怎么编霄灯吗？蒙蒙不会编霄灯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410104"
            ]
          },
          "413410104": {
            "id": "413410104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "穿过去，弄过来，一不小心材料就掉了，要不然就把线弄断了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410105"
            ]
          },
          "413410105": {
            "id": "413410105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "蒙蒙本来是想编盏霄灯送给小羽的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410106"
            ]
          },
          "413410106": {
            "id": "413410106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "小羽一直在看茶店，没有时间玩，也没有时间做霄灯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410107"
            ]
          },
          "413410107": {
            "id": "413410107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "但是小羽应该有愿望想要许吧，所以蒙蒙就想编一盏霄灯送给他…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410110"
            ]
          },
          "413410110": {
            "id": "413410110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "可是，蒙蒙想自己编好之后送给小羽…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410111"
            ]
          },
          "413410111": {
            "id": "413410111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "而且，蒙蒙想知道做霄灯的诀窍，这样我还可以讲给小羽听。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410112"
            ]
          },
          "413410112": {
            "id": "413410112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，你能…你能教蒙蒙编一下霄灯吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410113"
            ]
          },
          "413410113": {
            "id": "413410113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "没问题。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410114"
            ]
          },
          "413410114": {
            "id": "413410114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "#谢谢{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410115"
            ]
          },
          "413410115": {
            "id": "413410115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "霄灯这样应该就…算是做好了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410116"
            ]
          },
          "413410116": {
            "id": "413410116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "#谢谢你，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}！我们赶快把霄灯送给小羽吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134102",
      "subQuestName": "陪蒙蒙去见小羽",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413410201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413410201": {
            "id": "413410201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "客、客官，你好，那个…想要歇脚的话请…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410203"
            ]
          },
          "413410203": {
            "id": "413410203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们是来送霄灯的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410204"
            ]
          },
          "413410204": {
            "id": "413410204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "送霄灯…？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410205"
            ]
          },
          "413410205": {
            "id": "413410205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "小羽，这盏霄灯送给你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410206"
            ]
          },
          "413410206": {
            "id": "413410206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "蒙蒙？咦，这盏霄灯是你做的吗？谢、谢谢你…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410207"
            ]
          },
          "413410207": {
            "id": "413410207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "#是这个{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}教我编的，其实做得不太好，你…你喜欢吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410208"
            ]
          },
          "413410208": {
            "id": "413410208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "这盏霄灯做的很好啊！我很喜欢的，我还正在发愁，怎么抽出时间来编霄灯呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410209"
            ]
          },
          "413410209": {
            "id": "413410209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "谢谢你蒙蒙，我等会就去请人帮我把这盏霄灯挂到门上去。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410212"
            ]
          },
          "413410212": {
            "id": "413410212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "这个啊，嗯…我爸爸身体一直不好，不能过来挂霄灯。我个子又太矮，肯定也挂不上去…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410213"
            ]
          },
          "413410213": {
            "id": "413410213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "想把霄灯挂到门上去，只能去周围请人帮忙了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134103",
      "subQuestName": "挂霄灯",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134104",
      "subQuestName": "与小羽对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413410401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413410401": {
            "id": "413410401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "#这霄灯挂起来真好看，谢谢你，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410402"
            ]
          },
          "413410402": {
            "id": "413410402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "那小羽…我们出去玩吧，我知道一个地方，那里的花可漂亮了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410403"
            ]
          },
          "413410403": {
            "id": "413410403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "#刚才{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}教我编霄灯了，去那边之后，我也教你编好不好？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410404"
            ]
          },
          "413410404": {
            "id": "413410404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "这个…还不行，我还得收拾店里，虽然没多少客人，但店里必须保持干净才好，这是爸爸叮嘱我的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410405"
            ]
          },
          "413410405": {
            "id": "413410405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "那…那我们不编霄灯，去那边说一会话好不好？一会就回来了，不耽误时间的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410406"
            ]
          },
          "413410406": {
            "id": "413410406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "可是…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410409"
            ]
          },
          "413410409": {
            "id": "413410409",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "小羽",
            "text": "欸？可以吗？这也、这也太麻烦你了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410410"
            ]
          },
          "413410410": {
            "id": "413410410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "我们就去一小会，一小会就回来了，不会耽误很多时间的！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413410411"
            ]
          },
          "413410411": {
            "id": "413410411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "蒙蒙",
            "text": "#那就拜托你啦，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，谢谢你！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
